{"seq":2,"slug":"pack-throughput-dws-automation","title":"拣包产能与 DWS 称重量方自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cost-damage-balance/pack-throughput-dws-automation","wordCount":2486,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"拣包产能与-dws-称重量方自动化\">拣包产能与 DWS 称重量方自动化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前三章的算法都在算&quot;怎么装更省&quot;，但方案能不能落地取决于产线愿不愿意执行。工位操作员在每秒一件的节拍下，不会为了省两毛钱包材去挑一个更合身但需要三次折叠的箱型。所以装箱决策的<strong>执行代价</strong>必须被建模进产能模型，而产能模型又依赖实测数据的采集能力——这就是 DWS（称重、量方、扫码）设备的位置。</p>\n<p>DWS 是 Dimensioning-Weighing-Scanning 的缩写，指在同一工位上自动完成体积测量（3D 量方）、重量称量与条码识读。它把&quot;人工量箱&quot;变成&quot;过机即得&quot;，是让主数据（见 <a href=\"../dimension-packaging-masterdata/item-dimension-weight-masterdata\">尺寸主数据</a>）能持续保鲜的物理基础。没有它，主数据只能靠供应商申报，而供应商申报的偏差会在几批货之后就足以毁掉选箱精度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[包裹入线] --&gt; B[扫码识读]&#10;  B --&gt; C[3D 量方]&#10;  B --&gt; D[称重]&#10;  C --&gt; E[体积重计算]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{与申报差异超阈?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[放行并回写主数据]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[复核工位 / 重新计费]&#10;  G --&gt; I[产能与精度指标]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[包裹入线] --&gt; B[扫码识读]\n  B --&gt; C[3D 量方]\n  B --&gt; D[称重]\n  C --&gt; E[体积重计算]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{与申报差异超阈?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[放行并回写主数据]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[复核工位 / 重新计费]\n  G --&gt; I[产能与精度指标]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"dws-的技术构成\">DWS 的技术构成</h2><h3 id=\"量方原理与精度边界\">量方原理与精度边界</h3><p>量方的主流原理有两类：结构光/飞行时间的深度相机重建，以及多相机立体视觉。两者都在做同一件事——从点云里拟合物体的最小包围盒。精度受表面材质影响显著：哑光纸箱稳定，透明薄膜、高反光金属与深色绒面会显著劣化，因为深度信息在这些表面上容易缺失或跳变。</p>\n<p>这直接决定了工程上的两条设计规则。第一，DWS 的输出必须带<strong>置信度或质量标记</strong>（点云有效点占比、拟合残差），低置信度的读数不能直接回写主数据。第二，量方精度必须在<strong>安装位置现场标定</strong>，不能照搬出厂参数，因为安装高度、背景物体与照明都会改变误差分布。</p>\n<h3 id=\"称重的法定要求\">称重的法定要求</h3><p>用于贸易结算的重量必须来自经法定检定的衡器。欧盟有 2014/31/EU 与 2014/32/EU 指令规范非自动与自动衡器，美国则有 NIST Handbook 44，其 <strong>2.20 Scales</strong> 一节与附录 D 的定义构成商用衡器的技术要求（见 <a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/pml/weights-and-measures/publications/nist-handbooks/handbook-44-current-edition\">NIST Handbook 44 2026 版</a>）。工程含义很直接：如果打算用 DWS 数据与承运人争议计费重，那台设备必须是法定检定范围内、且在校准有效期内的设备。工位上的普通电子秤读数在争议中不被采信。</p>\n<p>另一个细节是重力加速度的影响：同一台秤在不同地点的读数会出现系统性差异，量级可达 0.5%（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weighing_scale\">Weighing scale</a> 对重力随地点变化的说明）。跨境多仓共用一套标定时，这个差异必须被校准吸收，否则会出现&quot;深圳仓称出来总是比上海仓重一点&quot;这类无法解释的系统性偏差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"扫码与数据关联\">扫码与数据关联</h3><p>扫码环节的工程重点不在识读率，而在<strong>关联正确性</strong>。一个包裹在线上可能有多张条码（面单、箱唛、商品码），量方与称重的结果必须准确绑定到正确的业务实体（订单号或托盘单元 SSCC）。绑定错误的后果比读取失败严重得多——它会静默地污染主数据。因此 DWS 的回写必须带完整的关联证据链，且允许下游按设备与批次追溯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"产能模型\">产能模型</h2><h3 id=\"节拍分解\">节拍分解</h3><p>单个工位的产能由一组串行动作的节拍决定。设各动作耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则理论产能为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3600</mn><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>件/小时</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{theo} = \\frac{3600}{\\sum_i t_i} \\quad (\\text{件/小时})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eo</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3072em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3600</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小时</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际产能乘以一个效率因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>（受换箱、补料、异常处理影响），得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{real} = e \\cdot Q_{theo}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eo</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这里的价值在于<strong>分解</strong>：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 拆成&quot;取箱&quot;&quot;放商品&quot;&quot;加填充&quot;&quot;封箱&quot;&quot;贴标&quot;&quot;过 DWS&quot;，就能看出哪一段是瓶颈。</p>\n<p>箱型种类数会显著影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>取箱</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{取箱}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">取箱</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——工位旁的包材架容量有限，箱型越多，找箱与补箱的时间越长。这是选箱算法应当知道的约束：如果算法在一天里用了 40 种箱型，操作侧的实际节拍会显著下降，省下的包材钱可能被产能损失吃掉。可行做法是在目标函数里给&quot;箱型切换&quot;一个惩罚项，把箱型收敛到 10 种以内。</p>\n<p>各动作对箱型多样性的敏感度差别很大，值得分开看：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>典型耗时占比</th>\n<th>是否随箱型种类上升</th>\n<th>改善抓手</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>取箱</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是（找箱、补箱）</td>\n<td>收敛箱型、优化料架布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放商品与摆放</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>摆放指令的可执行性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加填充</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是（不同箱型填充量不同）</td>\n<td>优先选免填充方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封箱贴标</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>设备化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过 DWS</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>线速与抽样策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这五项按实际测量填上自家数字，就能看出该优化标箱动作还是该优化箱型结构。一个常见的结论是：<strong>放商品与摆放</strong>往往占比最高，而它恰恰是最不受箱型数量影响的一项——这意味着单纯收敛箱型对总产能的改善有限，真正的瓶颈可能在工位的空间布局与商品可及性上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法与产能的交互\">算法与产能的交互</h3><p>装箱方案的设计直接影响操作时间。需要折叠成型的箱型（如全日盖箱）比开槽箱（RSC，如 FEFCO 0201）慢；需要内衬定位的比只放缓冲的慢；大箱需要两人搬运。因此方案输出里应当包含一个<strong>预估操作时长</strong>字段，让产线排班能据此配人，也让算法能把时间成本计入总分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自动化分拣与-dws-的衔接\">自动化分拣与 DWS 的衔接</h3><p>DWS 通常与自动分拣线共位：包裹过 DWS 后按体积重或目的地分流入格口。这时 DWS 的速度成为整线瓶颈，因为量方比称重和扫码都慢。常见做法是对小件采用&quot;抽样量方 + 重量定档&quot;的混合策略——只对体积不确定的包裹做完整量方，其余用重量与历史尺寸估算，从而把线速提上去。这个策略的代价是部分包裹的计费重估偏，需要在指标上监控&quot;事后争议率&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据回流与质量监控\">数据回流与质量监控</h2><h3 id=\"回写策略\">回写策略</h3><p>DWS 数据的回写遵循第 1 章确立的原则：只追加、带置信度、按用途设容差。此外还有两条 DWS 特有的规则。第一，<strong>同一包裹的重复测量要合并</strong>——多次过机会产生多条记录，主数据应当取稳定值（如中位数）而不是最后一条。第二，<strong>回写必须能区分商品与箱体</strong>：DWS 量的是已装箱的外廓，而主数据需要的是商品净尺寸。直接从已装箱外廓反推商品尺寸是错的，因为它包含箱体与缓冲。正确做法是分两处采集：入货时的裸件量方用于主数据，出货时的整箱量方用于计费重核对。</p>\n<h3 id=\"已知标准件复核的计算\">已知标准件复核的计算</h3><p>漂移监控本身可以做成一个可累计的统计量，而不是每天看一个孤立读数。用<strong>指数加权移动平均</strong>（EWMA）跟踪偏差，既平滑了噪声，又对新出现的系统偏移保持敏感：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}_t = \\alpha d_t + (1-\\alpha)\\bar{d}_{t-1}, \\qquad \\alpha \\in (0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9812em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0812em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 取小值则对缓慢漂移不敏感但历史平滑，取大值则响应快但噪声大。工程上常用的折中是令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 对应一个十到三十件样本的等效窗口。判据可以同时看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9812em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的绝对值（系统偏移）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|d_t - \\bar{d}_t|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0812em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>（单次异常）。前者超容差触发重新标定，后者超容差触发对该件单独复核。把两种失效分开，能避免&quot;一次误读就让整台设备停产重标&quot;这种过度反应。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class DriftMonitor:&#10;    def __init__(self, alpha=0.15, bias_limit_mm=3.0, outlier_limit_mm=15.0):&#10;        self.alpha = alpha&#10;        self.bias_limit = bias_limit_mm&#10;        self.outlier_limit = outlier_limit_mm&#10;        self.ema = None&#10;&#10;    def observe(self, measured_mm, reference_mm):&#10;        d = measured_mm - reference_mm&#10;        self.ema = d if self.ema is None else self.alpha * d + (1 - self.alpha) * self.ema&#10;        if abs(self.ema) &gt; self.bias_limit:&#10;            return &quot;recalibrate&quot;                    # 系统性漂移&#10;        if abs(d - self.ema) &gt; self.outlier_limit:&#10;            return &quot;review_item&quot;                    # 单次异常读数&#10;        return &quot;ok&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DriftMonitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bias_limit_mm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, outlier_limit_mm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bias_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bias_limit_mm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.outlier_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outlier_limit_mm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ema </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, measured_mm, reference_mm):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reference_mm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ema </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ema </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ema) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bias_limit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"recalibrate\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 系统性漂移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ema) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.outlier_limit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"review_item\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 单次异常读数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ok\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"精度漂移监控\">精度漂移监控</h3><p>DWS 设备会漂移。可用的监控手段是做<strong>已知标准件复核</strong>：每天用一两个尺寸与重量已知的标准块过机，记录读数偏差。偏差超出容差就触发重新标定。这比等到客户投诉计费重不对再排查要便宜得多。同时这条记录本身就是与承运人争议时的举证材料——证明你的设备在当天是准的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指标\">指标</h3><p>三个指标足以管住 DWS 这一环：<strong>有效读数率</strong>（成功量方且置信度达标的包裹占比）、<strong>与账单偏差率</strong>（DWS 计费重与承运人账单的偏差分布）、<strong>争议胜率</strong>（申诉成功的占比）。第三个指标反映的是数据质量的综合结果，也是这套投入能不能回本的最直接证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>装箱方案的执行代价必须进产能模型，否则省下的包材钱会被产线节拍吃掉。</li>\n<li>DWS 的量方精度受材质影响，输出必须带置信度；称重用于结算时必须有法定检定。</li>\n<li>重力差导致的系统性偏差需要在校准中吸收，多仓共标定尤其要注意。</li>\n<li>扫码环节的风险主要在关联正确性而非识读率，错误关联会静默污染主数据。</li>\n<li>产能要分解到动作级别，箱型种类数会显著影响取箱时间，目标函数应有切换惩罚。</li>\n<li>DWS 回写区分裸件与整箱两种场景；用标准件复核监控漂移，其记录同时也是争议举证材料。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸\">延伸</h2><p>DWS 回写的目标表结构见 <a href=\"../dimension-packaging-masterdata/item-dimension-weight-masterdata\">商品长宽高/重量实测与尺寸主数据</a>；实测数据最终服务的成本决策见 <a href=\"material-damage-dimweight-tradeoff\">包材成本/破损率/体积重权衡</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拣包产能与 DWS 称重量方自动化","id":"拣包产能与-dws-称重量方自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DWS 的技术构成","id":"dws-的技术构成"},{"level":3,"text":"量方原理与精度边界","id":"量方原理与精度边界"},{"level":3,"text":"称重的法定要求","id":"称重的法定要求"},{"level":3,"text":"扫码与数据关联","id":"扫码与数据关联"},{"level":2,"text":"产能模型","id":"产能模型"},{"level":3,"text":"节拍分解","id":"节拍分解"},{"level":3,"text":"算法与产能的交互","id":"算法与产能的交互"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化分拣与 DWS 的衔接","id":"自动化分拣与-dws-的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"数据回流与质量监控","id":"数据回流与质量监控"},{"level":3,"text":"回写策略","id":"回写策略"},{"level":3,"text":"已知标准件复核的计算","id":"已知标准件复核的计算"},{"level":3,"text":"精度漂移监控","id":"精度漂移监控"},{"level":3,"text":"指标","id":"指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸","id":"延伸"}],"prev":{"title":"包材成本/破损率/体积重权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cost-damage-balance/material-damage-dimweight-tradeoff"},"next":{"title":"减材轻量化与装载率指标（边界144）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cost-damage-balance/lightweighting-load-rate-metric"}}